OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA warm
OL,6,Fevening with plenty of late sunshine.
OL,7,FStaying largely dry overnight although
OL,8,Fthe odd light shower can't be entirely
OL,9,Fruled out. Warmer than recent nights.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FSmall chance of a brief light
OL,12,Fshower first thing but otherwise
OL,13,Fanother dry day is expected with
OL,14,Fprolonged periods of strong sunshine.
OL,15,FWarmer than on Saturday, perhaps hot
OL,16,Ffor some.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
