OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FSome
OL,6,Fpatchy cloud at first Monday and also
OL,7,Fless. Otherwise sunny and hot again
OL,8,FTuesday and Wednesday, especially
OL,9,Finland. Breezy at times, particularly
OL,10,Falong coasts.
